title: Police and Internal Security
subtitle: The Interior: the police, the investigation of named violence, protection, and a limited autonomy.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_security_rules && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'internal_security') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.internal_security (technical reference 16.3, 17.12.2, 17.12.6; card catalogue 8.12). Opening and
// closing the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action. The police stay an organ of the state:
// a change of government neither undoes the training nor makes them an organisation of PPS.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'internal_security');
Q.pl_police_line = PolishSecurity.policeLine(Q);
!}

= Police and internal security

[+ pl_police_line +]

An investigation names a recorded case; its label points to the case, not to a proof of guilt. The autonomy delegates schools, the official language and cultural institutions of one area to its self-government; it is an alternative of the game.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @professionalization
- @investigate_far_right
- @investigate_communist
- @police_protection
- @limited_autonomy
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@professionalization
title: Professionalise the police and subordinate it to lawful authorities
subtitle: 1 B for three months; then command and lawful compliance +10, once in the chapter.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'professionalization').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_professionalization_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'professionalization');
!}
go-to: result

@investigate_far_right
title: Investigate the named violence of the far right
subtitle: 1 B for one month; needs a recorded case. A confirmed investigation assigns the case to a party.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'investigate_far_right').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_investigate_far_right_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'investigate_far_right');
!}
go-to: result

@investigate_communist
title: Investigate the named violence of the communists
subtitle: 1 B for one month; needs a recorded case. A confirmed investigation assigns the case to a party.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'investigate_communist').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_investigate_communist_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'investigate_communist');
